WEBVTT

00:16.090 --> 00:19.360
All the unfair stuff that adults keep doing?

00:19.540 --> 00:19.580
PRESENTED BY DOUTEI SUBS

00:23.710 --> 00:26.330
"You better keep your promises!"

00:26.330 --> 00:28.580
Look who's talking!

00:30.360 --> 00:32.450
Live by what you preach.

00:33.540 --> 00:36.440
All those misplaced sympathies,

00:36.440 --> 00:38.970
nuh-uh, no way, I don't want.

00:38.970 --> 00:41.620
"I'm only saying this for your own sake!"

00:41.620 --> 00:43.680
I can smell the lie from here.

00:43.680 --> 00:46.520
When I hear your true desires,

00:46.520 --> 00:49.090
I dunno what I'll do from there.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.280
Should we do it?

00:50.280 --> 00:54.410
That's for me to decide.

00:54.410 --> 00:58.670
"If I spoil her, she'll just take advantage of it."

00:58.670 --> 01:04.120
You are so thickheaded, you'll never understand.

01:04.450 --> 01:08.770
If you truly care for me, it will surely lead to

01:08.770 --> 01:13.390
me becoming a more honest, gentle girl.

01:13.890 --> 01:18.470
And I hope you find me totally adorable.

01:18.910 --> 01:21.370
That I'll be.

01:21.370 --> 01:23.960
That's true.

01:23.960 --> 01:25.990
Naturally.

01:33.830 --> 01:35.150
Hey...

01:36.250 --> 01:37.570
Reiji...

01:37.570 --> 01:40.860
Should I go with this one or this one?

01:40.860 --> 01:44.970
The T-shirt with the culottes, or the tank-top with the miniskirt?

01:46.210 --> 01:47.580
Pick the least revealing!

01:47.580 --> 01:49.770
The T-shirt and culottes!

01:50.550 --> 01:51.960
Okay, these then!

01:51.960 --> 01:53.470
Rin!

01:58.220 --> 02:03.180
HOLD ME
TIGHTLY

01:58.220 --> 02:03.180
8th Period

02:01.270 --> 02:02.490
Good morning!

02:02.490 --> 02:03.220
Good morning, Sensei!

02:04.550 --> 02:05.770
Sensei, good morning!

02:05.770 --> 02:07.550
Yes, good morning!

02:07.550 --> 02:09.430
Your necktie is crooked.

02:09.430 --> 02:11.220
Eh? Ahh...

02:11.220 --> 02:12.980
S-Sorry!

02:12.980 --> 02:15.370
This is a new trimester.

02:15.370 --> 02:17.870
The first sign of slacking off shows up in the attire-

02:16.930 --> 02:18.360
Sensei!

02:22.770 --> 02:24.630
It's been too long.

02:24.630 --> 02:26.870
Were you wonely wifout Win awound?

02:27.250 --> 02:31.050
Nah, I feel like we've spent the entire summer break seeing each other-

02:31.050 --> 02:32.630
Aoki-sensei!

02:38.370 --> 02:41.250
STAFF OFFICE

02:38.990 --> 02:41.260
Please refrain from excessive touching!

02:41.260 --> 02:43.990
B... But that was <i>from</i> a kid-

02:43.990 --> 02:46.130
It's sexual harassment to anyone who sees it!

02:46.130 --> 02:49.430
<i>Yeah, except I'm<i> the one being sexually harassed.</i></i>

02:49.430 --> 02:54.940
In any case, make sure to avoid all bodily
contact with female children, are we clear?

02:57.410 --> 03:02.350
Shirai-sensei... she seems more intense than usual.

03:02.350 --> 03:06.430
That's because Nogi-sensei is
coming for a visit after school.

03:06.430 --> 03:07.830
Nogi-sensei?

03:07.830 --> 03:10.960
She taught the lower grades up until last year.

03:11.370 --> 03:13.910
She was Shirai-sensei's contemporary.

03:13.910 --> 03:17.990
She was such a gentle individual, all the students adored her.

03:17.990 --> 03:21.090
She quit once she became married, and is now living a woman's dream.

03:21.090 --> 03:23.190
Wow...

03:23.190 --> 03:27.600
I really think Shirai-sensei sees her as her rival.

03:27.600 --> 03:31.690
It's like, "I may have lost to her as a woman, but as a teacher...!"

03:31.690 --> 03:33.570
"Lost"?

03:34.390 --> 03:39.110
That's why she's overreacting when she thinks you sexually harassed a third-grader.

03:41.130 --> 03:43.690
Overreacting... huh?

03:48.850 --> 03:52.350
That's because Houin-sensei is herself a woman.

03:52.350 --> 03:53.500
Then there's...

03:57.790 --> 04:01.570
There might be some merit
to what Shirai-sensei said.

04:02.850 --> 04:04.350
That being said...

04:06.010 --> 04:07.510
Sensei!

04:07.510 --> 04:09.850
Do you wanna see my panties?

04:09.850 --> 04:12.430
They're really lacy and totally cute!

04:12.430 --> 04:15.370
Little girls shouldn't say those things!

04:15.370 --> 04:18.610
Well, if I keep saying them anyway, then that must make me a boy!

04:19.290 --> 04:22.360
Sensei, do you wanna check and make sure?

04:23.870 --> 04:26.210
Getting angry doesn't work with her.

04:26.210 --> 04:29.270
Are my constant reactions to
her antics the real problem?

04:29.270 --> 04:30.370
If that's the case...

04:30.890 --> 04:33.450
I won't talk to you if you
keep saying those things!

04:33.450 --> 04:34.120
Huh?

04:35.150 --> 04:37.880
Sensei, can I kiss you on the cheek?

04:42.470 --> 04:46.470
Hey... can you hold me on your lap?

04:50.350 --> 04:51.470
Hey!

04:58.030 --> 04:59.440
Sensei!

05:00.290 --> 05:02.690
Oh, am I finally getting to her?

05:02.690 --> 05:06.090
It's getting bigger... and bigger...

05:07.110 --> 05:09.790
Just messing with ya!

05:09.790 --> 05:14.120
Ee-hee-eew, gross Sensei! Your face got <i>soo</i> red!

05:09.880 --> 05:11.790
Cleaner! Now!

05:11.790 --> 05:15.330
Rin-chan, wash your hands! Disinfect!

05:15.850 --> 05:18.040
Saucy little brat!

05:18.530 --> 05:21.560
Wee-wees... get even bigger?

05:21.560 --> 05:25.540
When? Why? How does it happen?

05:26.140 --> 05:31.030
Anyway, little girls shouldn't be getting too clingy with their teachers. Is that clear?

05:31.930 --> 05:33.060
What's with that?

05:33.390 --> 05:36.060
That's just how it is. It's common sense!

05:39.410 --> 05:40.060
Rin-chan!

05:50.280 --> 05:51.620
Let's go!

05:53.750 --> 05:54.870
It's not fair.

05:55.330 --> 05:57.330
<i>They</i> get to hold him all they want.

05:59.170 --> 05:59.880
It's not fair.

05:59.880 --> 06:01.950
Hey, Rin-chan... huh?

06:06.750 --> 06:08.460
Kuro-chan, good timing!

06:09.390 --> 06:09.970
Huh?

06:10.460 --> 06:13.470
Now, after school...

06:16.730 --> 06:19.590
Rin-chan!

06:23.230 --> 06:25.530
I guess Rin-chan isn't here.

06:25.530 --> 06:28.900
And I brought the makeup like she told me.

06:31.550 --> 06:33.910
'Sup, Kuro. What kept ya?

06:34.250 --> 06:36.910
Hah? Who the hell are you?

06:36.910 --> 06:38.870
Kokonoe Rin.

06:40.350 --> 06:41.420
Rin-chan?!

06:41.790 --> 06:43.350
But your hair...

06:43.350 --> 06:46.330
I tied it and put it down my back.

06:46.330 --> 06:48.790
And I made it black with some color spray.

06:48.790 --> 06:51.430
Now I can get as close as I want with Sensei!

06:53.390 --> 06:55.890
Rin-chan... is hot!

06:55.890 --> 06:57.310
K... Kuro-chan?

06:57.310 --> 07:00.930
Kuro-chan, show me how to make myself up to look more boyish.

07:00.930 --> 07:03.310
Like making my eyebrows bigger.

07:03.310 --> 07:04.060
Roger!

07:04.810 --> 07:06.870
Kuro-chan, are you sure about this?

07:06.870 --> 07:09.330
Rin-chan is trying to get closer to Sensei.

07:09.330 --> 07:12.890
No, it's fine. She's doing it as a boy.

07:12.890 --> 07:16.450
You can't get lovey-dovey with
someone from the same sex...

07:16.450 --> 07:17.170
Uh-

07:22.590 --> 07:25.690
That... backfired on me.

07:25.690 --> 07:27.090
Kuro-chan...

07:29.310 --> 07:31.870
Do we have to make a fake name tag too?

07:31.870 --> 07:34.350
Yeah, just come up with whatever last name you can think of.

07:37.830 --> 07:40.600
Doing this brings back memories...

07:41.470 --> 07:44.860
Rin-chan as... my very own...

07:47.790 --> 07:51.130
From this day forward, we are all friends.

07:51.130 --> 07:52.850
Let's get to know each other!

07:52.850 --> 07:56.190
Okay!

07:56.190 --> 07:59.110
I just knew public schools were
full of dumpy loser kids!

07:59.110 --> 08:01.710
I bet I stand out a lot!

08:01.710 --> 08:03.330
That girl, she's cute!

08:03.330 --> 08:04.830
Which girl?

08:03.710 --> 08:04.830
She's right!

08:04.830 --> 08:07.070
She's so cute with that long hair!

08:07.070 --> 08:08.690
What's with that girl?

08:08.690 --> 08:12.170
Her white skin... her long, dark eyelashes...

08:12.170 --> 08:14.840
She's just like a doll.

08:18.610 --> 08:20.390
Kuro-chan puts me off.

08:20.390 --> 08:23.370
She acts high and mighty
and brags about her clothes.

08:23.370 --> 08:25.650
Don't you agree, Mimi-chan?

08:26.910 --> 08:29.890
<i>But Kuro-chan really is<i> cute.</i></i>

08:29.890 --> 08:32.110
Her clothes make her look like a princess.

08:32.110 --> 08:33.250
Um...

08:33.250 --> 08:35.660
But if I tell them that...

08:36.110 --> 08:37.570
Umm....

08:37.570 --> 08:39.790
Why aren't you talking to us?

08:41.570 --> 08:44.540
If you don't want to talk, then fine!

08:44.540 --> 08:46.050
Let's go!

08:50.850 --> 08:54.010
Say, where did you go to kindergarten?

08:54.010 --> 08:58.750
I feel sorry seeing you all
alone, so I'll be your friend.

09:02.870 --> 09:04.770
What kind of brand is that dress?

09:05.510 --> 09:07.270
I know it's cheap...

09:07.850 --> 09:09.890
What? Handmade?

09:09.890 --> 09:12.710
Oh my god, you're dirt poor!

09:17.780 --> 09:19.580
What?! Fine then!

09:24.210 --> 09:28.090
Okay, let's split into groups of
three and throw the balls around!

09:28.090 --> 09:28.990
Okay!

09:28.990 --> 09:31.950
Why did I have to be grouped with these two?

09:32.750 --> 09:35.340
I'm... kind of glad.

09:38.430 --> 09:40.380
A... Are you okay?

09:41.490 --> 09:44.230
Hey, apologize to her!

09:44.230 --> 09:46.210
I'm sure it didn't hurt.

09:46.210 --> 09:48.650
She ain't saying nothing, is she?

09:48.650 --> 09:51.550
She probably doesn't feel anything!

09:51.550 --> 09:53.280
You twerp! That's no reason to-

09:53.280 --> 09:55.410
Oh, I know why!

09:55.870 --> 09:59.030
She stopped talking when her mama died!

09:59.030 --> 10:01.350
She died? Wow!

10:01.350 --> 10:04.030
Clack... clack... clack... ding!

10:04.030 --> 10:04.540
Hey...

10:04.540 --> 10:05.670
What are you all doing?

10:05.670 --> 10:07.220
Whoops!

10:14.090 --> 10:18.090
STAFF OFFICE

10:15.670 --> 10:18.090
It's been a while, Nogi-sensei!

10:18.090 --> 10:21.090
You've become prettier since
the last time we saw you.

10:35.090 --> 10:36.950
Is Kokonoe...

10:36.950 --> 10:39.190
Is Rin-chan in your class?

10:39.190 --> 10:40.410
Eh-

10:40.410 --> 10:41.950
Ahh, yes!

10:50.090 --> 10:52.460
Wow! She looks like a grown up!

10:52.460 --> 10:55.090
Okay, close your eyes.

10:56.460 --> 11:00.970
She doesn't smile... she doesn't cry... and she doesn't say a word.

11:03.250 --> 11:05.060
She's my doll.

11:05.060 --> 11:07.510
Aw, Rin-chan's so cute!

11:08.570 --> 11:10.710
That's not all...

11:11.310 --> 11:13.630
Look! Lovely, isn't it?

11:13.630 --> 11:15.190
You will really look good in it!

11:17.270 --> 11:20.170
Huh, you're going to change her here?

11:20.170 --> 11:22.770
Sensei will get mad at you!

11:22.770 --> 11:23.950
It'll be fine!

11:24.790 --> 11:25.700
Besides...

11:26.530 --> 11:29.710
Rin-chan really does look like a doll.

11:29.710 --> 11:31.960
We have to check if she has a wee-wee.

11:31.960 --> 11:33.210
Wee-wee?

11:35.630 --> 11:38.010
Huh? So Rin-chan is really a boy-

11:38.010 --> 11:38.960
No!

11:39.610 --> 11:43.930
Didn't you know that girls also have really tiny wee-wees?

11:45.350 --> 11:48.350
Then... that means I also...

11:50.070 --> 11:52.570
Stand up. I'll dress you.

12:01.710 --> 12:06.620
My very own doll... I'll make
you even cuter and cuter!

12:08.510 --> 12:09.120
No...

12:09.590 --> 12:10.370
Huh?

12:11.530 --> 12:14.630
N... No...

12:15.590 --> 12:17.810
Rin-chan, you can talk?

12:17.810 --> 12:19.450
My... mo...

12:19.450 --> 12:20.630
Wh-What?

12:22.710 --> 12:26.260
My mo... ther's...

12:28.290 --> 12:29.630
Rin-chan...

12:32.190 --> 12:32.890
Huh?

12:33.430 --> 12:34.330
You girls...

12:34.330 --> 12:38.150
Sensei! I was just giving
Rin-chan a new dress... huh?

12:40.670 --> 12:41.260
Huh?

12:41.260 --> 12:43.410
M-Mimi-chan! What are you doing?!

12:43.410 --> 12:45.920
Um, I was seeing if I had a wee-wee.

12:45.920 --> 12:48.660
A... wee-wee?

12:50.070 --> 12:50.910
Sensei!

12:51.370 --> 12:53.170
Rin-chan talked!

12:57.990 --> 13:01.890
She said her mother made this dress.

13:01.890 --> 13:02.800
Am I right?

13:03.250 --> 13:08.050
Uh-huh. My... mo... ther's...

13:11.190 --> 13:12.410
Is...

13:13.070 --> 13:14.310
Is that so?

13:14.310 --> 13:17.730
Thank goodness... thank goodness.

13:23.210 --> 13:26.430
That Rin-chan Doll was <i>too</i> cute!

13:26.430 --> 13:29.590
Make her into a merchandise
and she'd be a big hit!

13:30.230 --> 13:32.030
I remember now!

13:32.030 --> 13:36.460
Back then you really loved treating other people like your toys.

13:36.870 --> 13:38.080
Didn't you?

13:40.710 --> 13:45.650
This kid scares me! This is domestic violence!

13:45.650 --> 13:48.370
Mimi-chan, save mee!

13:59.470 --> 14:05.190
Kokonoe-san... I mean, all kids will feel needy.

14:05.190 --> 14:09.810
Embrace their hearts along with the rest of them,

14:09.810 --> 14:11.200
Aoki-sensei.

14:14.200 --> 14:16.210
STAFF OFFICE

14:16.200 --> 14:18.790
"Embrace them," she says.

14:18.790 --> 14:23.070
I wonder if Nogi-sensei even considers the issues facing us teachers nowadays.

14:23.070 --> 14:25.470
I think her words rang true.

14:25.470 --> 14:28.370
The heart and body <i>are</i> connected.

14:31.210 --> 14:35.670
I give out hugs and piggy-back rides every day as a lower-grade teacher

14:35.670 --> 14:38.230
I'm telling you, both of my arms are sputtering.

14:38.230 --> 14:42.130
Teachers should not get involved in such areas.

14:42.130 --> 14:44.890
Touchy-feeliness is a job reserved for parents!

14:47.710 --> 14:49.370
Uh, I'll...

14:50.650 --> 14:52.230
I'll be heading home.

14:52.230 --> 14:54.510
Oh, I'll be seeing you!

14:54.510 --> 14:55.490
Good night!

14:59.810 --> 15:03.910
You haven't been embraced much, have you?

15:14.170 --> 15:17.830
Physical contact is a job reserved for parents, huh?

15:19.910 --> 15:22.510
But... if that's the case...

15:23.130 --> 15:26.730
What do we do... if the kid has no parents?

15:30.030 --> 15:32.530
Matsunami Ward Futatsubashi Elementary School

15:34.830 --> 15:35.660
Kokonoe!

15:36.290 --> 15:38.410
Uh... good morning!

15:40.660 --> 15:43.930
So, um... about yesterday-

15:43.930 --> 15:45.380
Sensei, good morning!

15:45.380 --> 15:47.670
Oh, yes... good morning!

15:56.010 --> 15:58.680
A FLEA'S HEART

16:04.310 --> 16:07.000
Hurry, hurry! Lunch break is about to end!

16:07.000 --> 16:09.450
Hold on, geez!

16:09.450 --> 16:10.910
There, done!

16:13.870 --> 16:16.370
You look like a boy in every way.

16:16.370 --> 16:20.350
God, and you were ignoring
that virgin all during class!

16:20.350 --> 16:22.330
That was then, this is now!

16:22.930 --> 16:24.960
Kuro-chan, Mimi-chan, thanks a lot!

16:30.030 --> 16:31.150
Bye!

16:33.490 --> 16:35.490
Rin-chan seems happy.

16:36.430 --> 16:41.310
I wonder if that's how it'll feel like if Rin-chan were really a boy.

16:42.550 --> 16:45.810
If Rin-chan were really a boy...

16:46.950 --> 16:49.870
Rin-kun, you can't!

16:50.790 --> 16:52.370
I'd be pregnant!

16:56.300 --> 16:58.330
Mi... Mimi-chan?

17:01.810 --> 17:03.160
Wait up!

17:12.170 --> 17:13.510
Gotcha!

17:14.750 --> 17:16.550
All right, that's one in the bag.

17:18.140 --> 17:20.230
Put me down!

17:20.230 --> 17:21.890
Hey, that's dangerous!

17:23.770 --> 17:25.570
You all right?

17:26.330 --> 17:27.900
You blockhead, it's because you were struggling.

17:29.150 --> 17:33.900
Ah, you're all muddy now.
Come on, off with the shirt.

17:33.900 --> 17:34.980
Eh?!

17:34.980 --> 17:36.400
I'm fine!

17:36.400 --> 17:38.060
No, you're not.

17:38.060 --> 17:40.370
I'll let you borrow my T-shirt.

17:40.370 --> 17:41.290
No!

17:41.290 --> 17:43.540
Noo!

17:43.540 --> 17:45.410
Ah, hey...!

17:48.810 --> 17:50.040
Aoki-sensei?

17:51.950 --> 17:53.830
Oh, sorry.

17:53.830 --> 17:57.230
I was playing with a boy from Class 2, and his clothes got all dirty.

17:57.230 --> 17:58.550
Oh, who was it?

17:58.550 --> 18:00.450
Um...

18:00.450 --> 18:03.060
I'm sure the name tag said "Itou."

18:03.060 --> 18:06.970
Hmm? There's no Itou in my class.

18:06.970 --> 18:08.390
Uh... what?

18:09.710 --> 18:10.440
Sensei...

18:10.860 --> 18:12.650
There's a strand of hair stuck on you.

18:13.730 --> 18:14.650
See?

18:15.990 --> 18:16.610
Huh?

18:24.210 --> 18:25.190
Kokonoe.

18:30.750 --> 18:33.880
Yep, so it was you all along.

18:35.030 --> 18:37.310
Why would you do something like that?

18:42.850 --> 18:44.090
I was wrong.

18:46.350 --> 18:49.140
Is there any way you can forgive me?

18:53.930 --> 18:58.030
I guess you got mad after I said little girls shouldn't get too close.

18:58.030 --> 19:03.970
Or rather, you got mad
after I... saw what I saw.

19:10.870 --> 19:12.040
I was wrong.

19:13.150 --> 19:16.050
Hit me, kick me, do whatever you like.

19:17.410 --> 19:21.490
In return, tomorrow we go back to the way things were. Forget this ever happened.

19:32.520 --> 19:33.560
Is she going to...

19:39.940 --> 19:43.200
Ye... owch!

19:45.200 --> 19:48.020
Get angry... it's fine...

19:48.020 --> 19:48.700
Huh?

19:48.700 --> 19:55.870
Get angry, yell at me... it's better
than not paying attention to me.

19:56.670 --> 19:58.460
Kokonoe...

19:59.230 --> 20:03.470
Never stop paying attention to me... ever!

20:11.170 --> 20:14.410
Embrace their hearts along with the rest of them.

20:16.210 --> 20:17.370
Kokonoe...

20:23.170 --> 20:24.430
I'm sorry, okay?

20:28.210 --> 20:33.030
I wonder if I can do that without messing up?

20:57.650 --> 20:59.850
Why that spot?

20:59.850 --> 21:02.530
I thought I told you earlier to go to bed.

21:03.800 --> 21:05.530
Her eyelids are red.

21:06.130 --> 21:07.490
She was crying?

21:08.550 --> 21:10.990
Rin... Rin?

21:10.990 --> 21:13.610
What's wrong? Can you talk?

21:15.810 --> 21:18.410
I knew it, it's still too much for her.

21:19.900 --> 21:23.530
I'm forcing her to be by herself for so long...

21:47.860 --> 21:49.940
I was tied by the rules crying my eyes out.

21:49.940 --> 21:52.520
Was I fed up so much I hit "C" and flew?

21:52.520 --> 21:54.950
If you wanna taste, go ahead and try it on the fly

21:54.950 --> 21:56.570
Heart racing, I get a flower on my test, smile and go

22:02.950 --> 22:05.520
Geh! No way! I'm not waiting ten years to LOVE LOVE!

22:05.520 --> 22:08.070
I can't resist, I've been dreaming of it ALL NIGHT.

22:08.070 --> 22:09.980
I will do what you say, MAYBE.

22:09.980 --> 22:13.150
For you, right now we'll have our WEDDING.

22:13.150 --> 22:15.670
Just tender kisses? NO NO! Adult thinking.

22:15.670 --> 22:18.220
We're taking it further and forceful - GO! IN!

22:18.220 --> 22:20.070
A HEART BEAT that is so loud.

22:20.070 --> 22:22.960
That's just how I do things, baby.

22:23.290 --> 22:28.560
Convey your feelings for me

22:28.560 --> 22:33.160
